    ],
    "notes": "Exact Steam pin of the public head observed 2026-09-21 (native Linux dedicated server, UE 5.8.2, changelist 376069). The bridge was re-proven on this pin at startup level in an isolated dev-servers rig: target stamp, identify with hosted Takaro, reachability over RCON, an empty player list, a console command, reconnect after a dropped socket, and a Takaro shutdown that exits the server process cleanly (slowly: about four and a half minutes). Chat delivery needs Enhanced Pippi plus the helper, the Takaro-owned TakaroConan.pak needs the Windows Epic DevKit and is not part of this target, and gameplay-level events are unverified. `takaro-maint verify --game conan-exiles` waits for the shared runner seam that lets a game name its container command and options; the adapter already ships both hooks."
  },
